# --- Rust ---
# Build output — ~500 MB here. Regenerate: cargo build [--release]
target/
# rustfmt backups
**/*.rs.bk
# stray local cargo caches (never commit these if they land in-tree)
.cargo/registry/
.cargo/git/

# --- generated artifacts ---
# demo renders — regenerate: cargo run --example <name> --release
*.wav
# wasm demo build output — regenerate: see harmonic_core/contrib/wasm-demo/README.md
harmonic_core/contrib/wasm-demo/harmonic_core.wasm
# plugin bundles live under target/ (already ignored)
# downloaded validation tooling (pluginval etc.)
harmonic_synth/tools/

# --- licensing ---
# The PRODUCTION signing secret and any real customer key files must never be
# committed. `keygen new` prints the secret to the terminal only; keep it in a
# password manager / the store webhook's env. The committed dev files
# (license/DEV_SECRET_KEY.txt, license/SAMPLE_LICENSE.key) are throwaway — see
# AGENTS.md "Security".
**/license.key
*PRODUCTION_SECRET*
*production-secret*
harmonic_synth/license/CUSTOMER_KEYS/

# --- test scratch ---
.playwright-mcp/

# --- editors / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
